{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-start|T13", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You park in front of Étienne’s place and turn off the ignition.", "passage": "981-04-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estacionas frente al departamento de Étienne y apagas el motor.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-start|T14", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You’ve known him for… years… Actually, since your first day behind the wheel.", "passage": "981-04-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Lo conoces desde hace… años… De hecho, desde tu primer día al volante.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-start|T15", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He was a skinny teenager you picked up late on Sunday nights to take back to his boarding school in the distant suburbs.", "passage": "981-04-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Era un adolescente flaco al que recogías tarde los domingos por la noche para llevarlo de vuelta a su internado en los suburbios lejanos.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-start|T16", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It was well paid, but depressing.", "passage": "981-04-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estaba bien pago, pero era deprimente.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-start|T17", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Étienne has since become a friend. And he’s got intel on one of your suspects… Jonas Piersson.", "passage": "981-04-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Desde entonces, Étienne se convirtió en un amigo. Y tiene información sobre uno de tus sospechosos… Jonas Piersson.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T24", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "…", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "source": "textasset", "es": "…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T26", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You knock on Étienne’s apartment door and he comes to open it. He’s now a muscle-bound giant who towers over you.", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "source": "textasset", "es": "Golpeas la puerta del departamento de Étienne y él va a abrir. Ahora es un gigante musculoso que te saca varias cabezas.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T27", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Come on in… don’t look at the mess. »", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Pasa… no mires el desorden. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T28", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He talks quickly and his voice is a touch colder than usual. Something’s not right.", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "source": "textasset", "es": "Habla rápido y su voz suena un poco más fría que de costumbre. Algo no anda bien.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T30", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You walk into his pristine apartment… oh wait, there’s a gym towel lying on the designer coffee table.", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "source": "textasset", "es": "Entras a su departamento impecable… ah, espera, hay una toalla de gimnasio tirada sobre la mesa de diseño.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T31", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Yeah, total pigsty. »", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "link": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, un chiquero total. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T32", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« You ok? »", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "link": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Estás bien? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T33", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Nice place. »", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "emote": ":smile:", "link": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Lindo lugar. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-entrance|T34", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Say nothing.)", "passage": "981-04-entrance", "emote": ":silence:", "link": "981-04-angry-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "(No decir nada.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry-intro|T38", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He heaves a heavy sigh. You’ve never seen him so stressed out.", "passage": "981-04-angry-intro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suelta un suspiro pesado. Nunca lo viste tan estresado.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry-intro|T39", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Shit… »", "passage": "981-04-angry-intro", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Mierda… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T44", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He collapses onto the couch. His attitude makes you want to stay standing.", "passage": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se deja caer en el sofá. Su actitud te dan ganas de quedarte parado.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T47", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You’re in deep shit… »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Estás en un problemón… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T49", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Huh? »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Eh? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T50", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« That guy you asked me to tail? I know him. Everyone knows him. »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Ese tipo que me pediste que investigara? Lo conozco. Todo el mundo lo conoce. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T51", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Jonas? »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Jonas? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T52", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He’s famous. He’s like your equivalent of… »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Es famoso. Es como el equivalente a… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T53", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He waves his hand at you.", "passage": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te hace un gesto con la mano.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T54", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« There are no famous taxi drivers. »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No existen los taxistas famosos. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T55", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Fine. Well, he’s famous. Like really famous. »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Bueno. Es famoso. Muy famoso. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T56", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« What’s so special about him? »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "emote": ":puzzled:", "link": "981-04-angry-who", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Qué tiene de especial? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T57", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« So what? »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "link": "981-04-angry-so", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Y qué? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry|T58", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« What’d you find out? »", "passage": "981-04-angry", "link": "981-04-intel-introA", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Qué averiguaste? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry-who|T62", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He wrote books about simulation theory. You know what that is? »", "passage": "981-04-angry-who", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Escribió libros sobre la teoría de la simulación. ¿Sabes qué es eso? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T68", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shake your head.", "passage": "981-04-theory", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sacudes la cabeza.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T69", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You have to imagine our reality is a simulation. That the universe isn’t run by God but by a computer… »", "passage": "981-04-theory", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Tienes que imaginar que nuestra realidad es una simulación. Que el universo no lo maneja Dios, sino una computadora… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T70", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« A computer running software we believe is reality. »", "passage": "981-04-theory", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Una computadora que corre un programa que creemos que es la realidad. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T71", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« That’s insane. »", "passage": "981-04-theory", "link": "981-04-theory-crazy", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Eso es una locura. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T72", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« That’s ridiculous. »", "passage": "981-04-theory", "link": "981-04-theory-no", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Eso es ridículo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory|T73", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« You get what I wanted? »", "passage": "981-04-theory", "link": "981-04-intel-introB", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Conseguiste lo que te pedí? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-crazy|T77", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Exactly. Insane… But potentially true. »", "passage": "981-04-theory-crazy", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Exacto. Una locura… Pero potencialmente cierta. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-crazy|T78", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Jonas is trying to figure out if it is… Which brings us to what you were looking for… »", "passage": "981-04-theory-crazy", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Jonas está tratando de averiguar si lo es… Lo que nos lleva a lo que buscabas… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-no|T83", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Not necessarily. Or at least, we don’t know. »", "passage": "981-04-theory-no", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No necesariamente. O al menos, no lo sabemos. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-no|T84", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« So it’s ridiculous. »", "passage": "981-04-theory-no", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Entonces es ridículo. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-no|T85", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Jonas is convinced it’s true, though. »", "passage": "981-04-theory-no", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Igual, Jonas está convencido de que es verdad. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-no|T86", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« And the intel I was looking for? »", "passage": "981-04-theory-no", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Y la información que buscaba? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-theory-no|T87", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« As it happens… there is a connection… »", "passage": "981-04-theory-no", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Da la casualidad… de que hay una conexión… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-angry-so|T92", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You don’t get it… I really admire this guy… we all do… »", "passage": "981-04-angry-so", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No entiendes… admiro mucho a este tipo… todos lo admiramos… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T97", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Yes, he told me about it. »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, me contó sobre eso. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T98", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You’ve met him? »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Lo conociste? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T99", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Yeah, I drove him. »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, lo llevé en el taxi. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T100", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He lets out a whistle.", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suelta un silbido.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T101", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He’s kind of scary, don’t you think? »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Da un poco de miedo, ¿no crees? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T102", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shrug.", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te encoges de hombros.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T103", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Not at all. »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "link": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Para nada. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T104", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Not really. »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "link": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "source": "textasset", "es": "« La verdad que no. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T105", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« A little. »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "link": "981-04-metbefore-outroB", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Un poco. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore|T106", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« I was a little concerned… »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore", "link": "981-04-metbefore-outroC", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Me preocupé un poco… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroA|T110", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Étienne leans forward in surprise.", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "source": "textasset", "es": "Étienne se inclina hacia adelante, sorprendido.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroA|T111", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Really? »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿En serio? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroA|T112", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Maybe I’m too big a fan? »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Tal vez soy demasiado fan? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroA|T113", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Maybe… »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroA", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Tal vez… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroB|T118", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Étienne smiles a little.", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroB", "source": "textasset", "es": "Étienne sonríe un poco.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroB|T119", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« There’s something magnetic about him… »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroB", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Tiene algo magnético… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroC|T124", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Étienne sits up.", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroC", "source": "textasset", "es": "Étienne se endereza.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-metbefore-outroC|T125", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Doesn’t surprise me… »", "passage": "981-04-metbefore-outroC", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« No me sorprende… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-introA|T130", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Oh! Right! You’ll see, it’s fascinating. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-introA", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¡Ah! ¡Cierto! Ya vas a ver, es fascinante. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-introB|T135", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Sorry, I’m talking too much… »", "passage": "981-04-intel-introB", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Perdón, estoy hablando demasiado… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T141", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your friend clears his throat.", "passage": "981-04-intel", "source": "textasset", "es": "Tu amigo se aclara la garganta.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T142", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You glance around and realize this young man must earn more in a day than you do in a week.", "passage": "981-04-intel", "source": "textasset", "es": "Miras alrededor y te das cuenta de que este joven debe ganar en un día más de lo que tú ganas en una semana.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T143", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "If not more.", "passage": "981-04-intel", "source": "textasset", "es": "O más.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T144", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« This simulation theory has recently led to the formation of several groups… extreme believers, you might say. »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Esta teoría de la simulación llevó recientemente a la formación de varios grupos… creyentes extremos, podría decirse. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T145", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Groups that want to test the theory. »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Grupos que quieren poner a prueba la teoría. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T148", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Or rather, who want to prove it’s true. »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« O más bien, que quieren demostrar que es cierta. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T149", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« But how? »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Pero cómo? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T150", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« By crashing the system… »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Haciendo colapsar el sistema… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T151", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He stands up and starts pacing.", "passage": "981-04-intel", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se pone de pie y empieza a caminar de un lado a otro.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T152", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Jonas is the leader of one of these groups. »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Jonas es el líder de uno de estos grupos. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T155", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« A terrorist? »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "link": "981-04-intel-terrorist", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Un terrorista? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T156", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« You think he could kill? »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "link": "981-04-intel-killer", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Crees que podría matar? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T157", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« All that just to prove a theory? »", "passage": "981-04-intel", "link": "981-04-intel-theory", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Todo eso solo para probar una teoría? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel|T158", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Say nothing.)", "passage": "981-04-intel", "emote": ":silence:", "link": "981-04-intel-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "(No decir nada.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-terrorist|T162", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He’s hesitant, but you can tell he agrees.", "passage": "981-04-intel-terrorist", "source": "textasset", "es": "Duda, pero notas que está de acuerdo.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-terrorist|T163", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« If you will… the term is a bit extreme, but… yes, I’d say so. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-terrorist", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Si quieres llamarlo así… el término es un poco extremo, pero… sí, diría que sí. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-killer|T168", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "There’s not an ounce of doubt in his voice when he says…", "passage": "981-04-intel-killer", "source": "textasset", "es": "No hay ni una pizca de duda en su voz cuando dice…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-killer|T169", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Kill…? Yes. No doubt. If it would prove his theory. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-killer", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Matar…? Sí. Sin dudas. Si eso probara su teoría. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-theory|T174", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Yes. He’s been obsessed with this theory for years. And he has the means to go all out… all the way… »", "passage": "981-04-intel-theory", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí. Lleva años obsesionado con esta teoría. Y tiene los medios para llegar hasta el final… hasta el final de verdad… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-theory|T175", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« All the way to murder? »", "passage": "981-04-intel-theory", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¿Hasta el asesinato? »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-silence|T180", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "His voice drops", "passage": "981-04-intel-silence", "source": "textasset", "es": "Su voz baja", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-silence|T181", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I know all this must seem… silly to you. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-silence", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sé que todo esto debe sonarte… tonto. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-outro|T186", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Étienne leans over to you. Every one of his arm muscles is flexed.", "passage": "981-04-intel-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "Étienne se inclina hacia ti. Cada músculo de sus brazos está en tensión.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-outro|T187", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I don’t really know what you need this information for but… watch your back. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-outro", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« La verdad no sé para qué necesitas esta información, pero… cuídate las espaldas. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-outro|T188", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Jonas is no altar boy. He’s nobody’s fool. Not your average nerd. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-outro", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Jonas no es ningún santo. No es tonto. No es el típico nerd. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-outro|T191", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« He could be dangerous. »", "passage": "981-04-intel-outro", "speaker": "ÉTIENNE", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Podría ser peligroso. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-intel-outro|T193", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "…", "passage": "981-04-intel-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end|T200", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A few minutes later, you’re back behind the wheel of your car.", "passage": "981-04-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "Unos minutos después, estás de vuelta al volante de tu auto.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end|T202", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You feel uneasy.", "passage": "981-04-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te sientes incómodo.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end|T203", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "All that is over your head. Simulation. Internet.", "passage": "981-04-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "Todo eso te supera. Simulación. Internet.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end|T204", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You barely know how to use your phone.", "passage": "981-04-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "Apenas sabes usar tu teléfono.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end-metbefore|T210", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You turn around… and stare at the back seat. It wasn’t so long ago that he was sitting right there…", "passage": "981-04-end-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "Te das vuelta… y te quedas mirando el asiento trasero. No hace tanto que él estaba sentado justo ahí…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end-metbefore|T211", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Maybe…", "passage": "981-04-end-metbefore", "source": "textasset", "es": "Tal vez…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end-final|T216", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Come on… »", "passage": "981-04-end-final", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Vamos… »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "981_Angel_04_Location|981-04-end-final|T217", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shake your head and start the cab. You’ve still got plenty of fish to fry.", "passage": "981-04-end-final", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sacudes la cabeza y arrancas el taxi. Todavía te quedan muchas cosas por resolver.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
